= 1r 2r 38. 2r 1d
= 1. 1r 1r 38. 1r 1d
= 1. 1r 2r 36. 2r 1d
= 1. 2r 2r 34. 2r 2d
= 2. 1r 2r 34. 2r 1d
= 2. 2r 2r 32. 2r 2d
